      "review_description": "installed quite quickly. Seems ok for panel installation. Inverter is on north-facing wall so I will need to build a roof/shelter for it. Its an old house so its difficult to do a spectacular install. Also, being in 'rural' Byron area, prices were not as competitive as city, but I think thats normal as the installers have higher overheads.Handover was not great - I downloaded the app and worked out how to pair it with the dongle. Its all working now though.Performance is pretty much as discussed with installer - no surprises. Changed retailer to get a better infeed tariff but its still just theft.Overall I feel the system is good - Jinko and Sungrow - and the install was done really quickly (plus score for installer). Easy enough to deal with installer, whom i found quite knowledgeable and receptive.",
