      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "I asked for email contact from two solar providers.  Two contacted me and they led to phone conversations with each one.  Both were polite, respectful of my lack of knowledge on the topic and there was no real difference in the information each provided on solar ie both were informed and gave similar advice.  They offered two different products and different system size.  Sanctury Solar was my final choice based on the range of options they offered ie two system sizes.  Price was also part of that decision, but not the principal factor.  The installation team were terrific.  Good natured people who worked with me and helped me to understand things.Since the installation, I worried because I hadn't heard from the electricity provider - however, one phone call resolved my worry.  I was given verbal support and reassurance.   I can only be very grateful for finding your site to lead me to all of these good people, doing a great job.  That includes the company I didn't select, they were also great.",
